links 542..547 title=Some("Link tester")

# documentation(links)
_links {links.R}_

## Link tester

------

### Description

See `wmean()`, `stats::sd()`, `dplyr::mutate`, the docs and
`code`. A real [link](https://example.com) stays. `[x]` stays in code.

### Usage

```r
links(x)
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `x` | Uses `stats::sd()`. |

### Details

Details with `fn` link and x[i] indexing.

### Value

A `list()`.

### Warnings

Be careful with `wmean()`.

Second paragraph.

### Other notes

Inline body.

### See Also

`wmean()`, `pkg::fn()`

Family: helpers

### Examples

```r
f(1)
if (TRUE) {
  f(2)
}
```

See `inst/examples/f.R`.

